8. Acceptance, breach and reinstatement

By exercising permissions that require this licence, You accept its conditions.
A material breach terminates the affected permissions. For a first notified breach,
they are reinstated if You stop the breach and take reasonable remedial steps
within 30 days of written notice. Further reinstatement requires the relevant
Licensor's written agreement. Lawful downstream permissions already granted are
not cancelled solely because Your permissions terminate.

